### ========================================================
### T3-01 PROYECTO MULTIBASE DE DATOS
### Web Service REST - Adolfo Rodríguez & Andrea Velázquez
### ========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 0. VER ESTADO DE LAS CONEXIONES Y API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ========================================================
### 1. RECURSO 1: USUARIOS (MySQL - Relacional)
### ========================================================

### 1.1 Listar usuarios activos (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios

### 1.2 Registrar usuario nuevo (POST)
# @name crearUsuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Carlos Mendoza",
  "email": "carlos.mendoza@itmorelia.edu.mx",
  "rol": "admin"
}

### 1.3 Obtener usuario por ID (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1

### 1.4 Actualizar usuario parcialmente (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rol": "supervisor"
}

### 1.5 Borrado logico de usuario (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1

### 1.6 Consultar usuario borrado para verificar activo=false (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1


### ========================================================
### 2. RECURSO 2: CLIENTES (MySQL - Relacional)
### ========================================================

### 2.1 Listar clientes activos (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes

### 2.2 Registrar cliente nuevo (POST)
# @name crearCliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Abarrotes Don Pepe",
  "telefono": "443-123-4567",
  "ciudad": "Morelia"
}

### 2.3 Obtener cliente por ID (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/1

### 2.4 Actualizar cliente (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ciudad": "Pátzcuaro"
}

### 2.5 Borrado logico de cliente (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/1

### 2.6 Consultar cliente borrado para verificar activo=false (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/1


### ========================================================
### 3. RECURSO 3: PRODUCTOS (MongoDB - NoSQL Documental)
### ========================================================

### 3.1 Listar productos activos (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productos

### 3.2 Crear producto (POST)
# @name crearProducto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/productos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Laptop Asus TUF Gaming",
  "categoria": "Computación",
  "precio": 18999.00,
  "stock": 10
}

### 3.3 Obtener producto por ID (Reemplazar ID de respuesta de POST)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productos/672900000000000000000001

### 3.4 Actualizar precio y stock de producto (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/productos/672900000000000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "precio": 17499.50,
  "stock": 8
}

### 3.5 Borrado logico de producto (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/productos/672900000000000000000001


### ========================================================
### 4. RECURSO 4: PEDIDOS (MongoDB - NoSQL Documental)
### ========================================================

### 4.1 Listar pedidos activos (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos

### 4.2 Crear pedido (POST)
# @name crearPedido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cliente": "Abarrotes Don Pepe",
  "total": 34999.00,
  "estado": "pendiente",
  "items": [
    { "producto": "Laptop Asus TUF Gaming", "cantidad": 2, "subtotal": 34999.00 }
  ]
}

### 4.3 Obtener pedido por ID (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos/672900000000000000000002

### 4.4 Cambiar estado de pedido (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos/672900000000000000000002
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "enviado"
}

### 4.5 Borrado logico de pedido (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/pedidos/672900000000000000000002


### ========================================================
### 5. RECURSO 5: SESIONES (Redis - Clave-Valor)
### ========================================================

### 5.1 Listar sesiones activas (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones

### 5.2 Crear sesion activa (POST)
# @name crearSesion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "sesion_usr_101",
  "usuarioId": 1,
  "token": "jwt_token_secret_xyz123",
  "ip": "189.200.45.12",
  "dispositivo": "Windows Chrome"
}

### 5.3 Consultar sesion (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/sesion_usr_101

### 5.4 Actualizar sesion (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/sesion_usr_101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ip": "189.200.45.99"
}

### 5.5 Borrado logico de sesion (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/sesion_usr_101

### 5.6 Consultar sesion para confirmar activo=false (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/sesion_usr_101


### ========================================================
### 6. RECURSO 6: CARRITOS (Redis - Clave-Valor)
### ========================================================

### 6.1 Listar carritos activos (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/carritos

### 6.2 Crear carrito de compras (POST)
# @name crearCarrito
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carritos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "cart_usr_101",
  "usuarioId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "producto": "Mouse Gamer Logitech", "precio": 650, "cantidad": 1 },
    { "producto": "Teclado Mecanico Redragon", "precio": 1200, "cantidad": 1 }
  ],
  "total": 1850.00
}

### 6.3 Obtener carrito (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/carritos/cart_usr_101

### 6.4 Actualizar carrito (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/carritos/cart_usr_101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "total": 2100.00
}

### 6.5 Borrado logico de carrito (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/carritos/cart_usr_101

### 6.6 Consultar carrito para verificar activo=false (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/carritos/cart_usr_101
